Hello,

I’m working with custom board STM32F767BITX, trying to interface Standalone USB Host MSC, with no Free RTOS.

Tried different reference, below is one reference which I followed

<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_bfROydrssA&t=2s>

As soon as connected USB, it shows connected but after that it loop between this two calls alternatively, USBH\_LL\_PortDisabled() and USBH\_LL\_PortEnabled() which disconnect USB and connect again and continue to do that.

So I dont understand the root cause of this, what trigger this to behave like this?

Please guide me to fix this issue.

